OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy with the chance
OL,6,Fof a few light showers, these mainly
OL,7,Facross the east. Best of any sunnier
OL,8,Fbreaks across western Tayside. Light
OL,9,Fwinds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening and
OL,12,Fnight with a few light showers, these
OL,13,Fmainly in the east. Any cloud breaks
OL,14,Facross the west will lead to patchy
OL,15,Ffrost and fog.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FLittle change, remaining
OL,18,Frather cloudy with a few light
OL,19,Fshowers, these mainly in the east.
OL,20,FBrighter spells across the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
